msgstr "Filter šumu speckle"

msgid ""
"Speckle filtering is only applied at zoom levels 12 and above for IW and "
"zoom levels 8 and above for EW acquisition. Zoom levels outside this range "
"will render without speckle filtering, even if it is set."
msgstr ""
"Filtrovanie šumu speckle sa používa iba pri úrovniach priblíženia 12 a "
"vyšších pre režim IW a pri úrovniach 8 a vyšších pre režim EW. Úrovne "
"priblíženia mimo tohto rozsahu sa vykreslia bez filtrovania šumu speckle, "
"aj keď je nastavené."

