msgid ""
"# VV - decibel gamma0\n"
"\n"
"This script displays a grayscale visualization of the gamma0 of the VV "
"polarization. Compared to the HH polarization, the VV polarization is more "
"sensitive to surface roughness and is therefore often used in the detection "
"of oil contamination or wake detection. Compared to the linear gamma0 "
"visualization, the decibel gamma0 visualization includes a logarithmic "
"scaling of the data."
msgstr ""
"# VV - decibelová gamma0\n"
"\n"
"Tento skript zobrazuje vizualizáciu gamma0 polarizácie VV v odtieňoch "
"sivej. V porovnaní s polarizáciou HH je polarizácia VV citlivejšia na "
"drsnosť povrchu, a preto sa často používa pri detekcii znečistenia ropou "
"alebo brázd za loďami. V porovnaní s vizualizáciou lineárnej gamma0 zahŕňa "
"vizualizácia decibelovej gamma0 logaritmické škálovanie údajov."

msgid ""
"# VV - linear gamma0\n"
"\n"
"This script displays a grayscale visualization of the gamma0 of the VV "
"polarization. Compared to the HH polarization, the VV polarization is more "
"sensitive to surface roughness and is therefore often used in the detection "
"of oil contamination or wake detection."
msgstr ""
"# VV - lineárna gamma0\n"
"\n"
"Tento skript zobrazuje vizualizáciu gamma0 polarizácie VV v odtieňoch "
